      "note": [
        "Reinvested earnings on foreign direct investment is derived from a calculation and this calculation is largely based on the dividends and income collected from the annual direct investment survey. For periods where there is no results from the annual survey, reinvested earnings are calculated from an income forecast and dividends that are not yet complete. These figures will be revised when results of the annual direct investment survey are published. Thus, until then, these figures should be deemed as preliminary.",
        "Reinvested earnings within direct investments has been adjusted for the reference period of first quarter of 2013 to the fourth quarter of 2022. The adjustment aims to better reflect the income measurement Net Operating Surplus (NOS)."
      ],
